    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>Can FIS help us determine which pathway applies to our family?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Family immigration can depend on several factors, including the relationship involved and each family member's circumstances. Tell us about your situation and we will assess which pathway or connected requirements may apply.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does marriage to a Filipino citizen guarantee a long-term visa?</summary>
        <p>No. Marriage may support eligibility for a long-term immigration pathway, but the relevant authority makes the final determination based on your specific circumstances. FIS can assess whether this pathway may be appropriate and coordinate the application on your behalf.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can FIS assist if children are also involved?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Where your family's plans involve children as well as a spouse, we can consider the connected immigration and documentation requirements together as part of the broader review.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

